'#  CheckBox.bi                                                                 #
'#  This file is part of MyFBFramework                                          #
'#  Authors: Nastase Eodor, Xusinboy Bekchanov, Liu XiaLin                      #
'#  Based on:                                                                   #
'#   TCheckBox.bi                                                               #
'#   FreeBasic Windows GUI ToolKit                                              #
