		cbDropDown
		cbDropDownList
		cbOwnerDrawFixed
		cbOwnerDrawVariable
	End Enum
	
	'`ComboBoxEdit` is a Control within the MyFbFramework, part of the freeBasic framework.
	'`ComboBoxEdit` - Combines the features of a [[TextBox]] and a [[ListControl]] (Windows, Linux, Web).
