[Compiler]
...' ellipsis upper bound given for array field (this is not supported) = 為陣列欄位指定的'...'省略號上限（不支持）
...' ellipsis upper bound given for dynamic array (this is not supported) = 動態陣列指定的'...'省略號上限（不支持）
~' parsed as equality operator in function argument, not assignment to BYREF function result = '='在函數參數中解析為相等運算子，未分配給BYREF函數結果
A destructor should not have any parameters = 析構函數不應具有任何參數
ABSTRACT used here, but not the in the DECLARE statement = 這裡使用了ABSTRACT，但在DECLARE語句中沒有使用
ABSTRACT used on non-member procedure = 非成員過程中使用ABSTRACT 
Accessing base UDT's private default constructor = 訪問基本UDT的私有預設構造函數
Accessing base UDT's private destructor = 訪問基本UDT的私有析構函數
ALIAS name here does not match ALIAS given in DECLARE prototype = 此處的ALIAS名稱與DECLARE原型中提供的ALIAS不匹配
ALIAS name string is empty = ALIAS名稱字串為空
Ambiguous call to overloaded function = 對重載函數的歧義調用
Ambiguous symbol access, explicit scope resolution required = 符號訪問不明確，需要明確的範圍解析
An ENUM, TYPE or UNION cannot be empty = ENUM，TYPE或UNION不能為空
Argument count mismatch = 參數計數不匹配
Array access, index expected = 訪問陣列需要索引
Array already dimensioned = 陣列維數已確定
Array boundaries do not match the original EXTERN declaration = 陣列邊界與原始EXTERN聲明不匹配
Array not dimensioned = 陣列未標注維數
Array of references - not supported yet = 引用的陣列-尚不支援
Array out-of-bounds = 陣列越界
Array too big = 陣列太大
Array too large for stack, consider making it var-len or SHARED = 陣列太大而不能堆疊，請考慮使其變長或共用(var-len or SHARED)
Arrays are not allowed = 不允許陣列
-asm att used for -gen gas, but -gen gas only supports -asm intel = 用-asm att在-gen gas,但是-gen gas僅支持-asm intel
-asm att|intel option given, but not supported for this target (only x86 or x86_64) = 已提供-asm att|intel 選項，但此目標不支援（僅x86或x86_64）
At least one parameter must be a user-defined type = 至少一個參數必須是用戶定義的類型
at parameter = 在參數表中的第
Auto variables are only valid in -lang = 自動變數僅在-lang中有效
BASE() initializer not at top of constructor = BASE()初始化程式不在構造函數的頂部
Both parameters can't be of the same type = 兩個參數不能屬於同一類型
Branch crossing local array, var-len string or object definition = 跨越了局部陣列，var-len字串或物件定義的分支
Branch crossing local variable definition = 分支交叉區域變數定義
Branching to other functions or to module-level = 到其他函數或模組級別的分支
Branching to scope block containing local variables = 到包含區域變數的作用域塊的分支
Byref function result not set = 未設置Byref函數結果
Calling convention does not match DECLARE prototype = 調用約定與DECLARE原型不匹配
Cannot export symbol without -export option = 沒有-export選項就無法匯出符號
Cannot modify a constant = 無法修改常數
Cannot pop stack, underflow = 無法彈出堆疊，下溢
Can't use ... as lower bound = 不能使用...作為下限
Can't use ANY as initializer in array with ellipsis bound = 不能在帶省略號的陣列中將ANY用作初始化程式
CASE without SELECT = CASE沒有 SELECT
Cast to non-pointer = 強制轉換為非指針
Casting derived UDT pointer from incompatible pointer type = 從不相容的指針類型轉換派生的UDT指針
Casting derived UDT pointer from unrelated UDT pointer type = 從不相關的UDT指針類型轉換派生的UDT指針
Casting derived UDT pointer to incompatible pointer type = 將派生的UDT指針轉換為不相容的指針類型
Casting derived UDT pointer to unrelated UDT pointer type = 將派生的UDT指針轉換為不相關的UDT指針類型
CLASS, TYPE or UNION has no constructor = CLASS，TYPE或UNION沒有構造函數
CLASS, TYPE or UNION not derived = 不能派生CLASS，TYPE或UNION
Cloning operators (LET, Copy constructors) can't take a byval arg of the parent's type = 克隆運算子（LET，Copy構造函數）不能採用父類型的byval參數
Command line option overrides directive = 命令列選項重載指令
COMMON variables cannot be object instances of CLASS/TYPE's with cons/destructors = COMMON變數不能是帶有缺點/析構函數的CLASS / TYPE的物件實例
Const UDT cannot invoke non-const method = const UDT無法調用非const方法
CONST used here, but not the in the DECLARE statement = 在此使用CONST，但在DECLARE語句中未使用
CONST used on constructor (not needed) = 在構造函數上使用CONST（不需要）
CONST used on destructor (not needed) = 在析構函數上使用CONST（不需要）
CONST used on non-member procedure = CONST用於非成員過程
Constant declared in anonymous UDT = 在匿名UDT中聲明的常量
Constructor declared ABSTRACT = 構造函式宣告為ABSTRACT
Constructor declared VIRTUAL = 構造函式宣告為虛擬
Constructor has no public access = 構造函數沒有公共存取權限
CONSTRUCTOR() chain call not at top of constructor = CONSTRUCTOR()的調用不在構造函數的頂部
Could not find file = 找不到檔
Declaration outside the original namespace = 在命名空間之外的聲明
Declaration outside the original namespace or class = 在原始命名空間或類之外的聲明
Default types or suffixes are only valid in -lang = 默認類型或尾碼僅在-lang中有效
Default types or suffixes are only valid in -lang deprecated or fblite or qb = 指定默認類型或使用尾碼已棄用，僅在 -lang 、fblite 或 qb 中有效
Deleting ANY pointers is undefined = 刪除任何指針是未定義的
Destructor declared ABSTRACT = 析構函式宣告為ABSTRACT
Destructor has no public access = 析構函數沒有公共存取權限
Directive ignored after first pass = 第一次通過後忽略指令
Division by zero = 被零除
Duplicated definition = 重複定義
Dynamic arrays cannot be part of UNION's or nested TYPE's = 動態陣列不能是UNION或嵌套TYPE的一部分
Dynamic arrays can't be const = 動態陣列不能為const
Element not defined = 元素未定義
Elements must be empty for strings and arrays = 字串和陣列的元素必須為空
ELSE without IF = ELSE沒有  IF
ELSEIF without IF = ELSEIF沒有  IF
END EXTERN without EXTERN = END EXTERN 沒有  EXTERN
END IF without IF = END IF沒有IF
END NAMESPACE without NAMESPACE = END NAMESPACE 沒有  NAMESPACE
END SCOPE without SCOPE = END SCOPE沒有 SCOPE
END SELECT without SELECT = END SELECT 沒有SELECT
END SUB or FUNCTION without SUB or FUNCTION = END SUB或FUNCTION，沒有SUB或FUNCTION
END WITH without WITH = END WITH沒有WITH
ENUM's declared inside EXTERN .. END EXTERN blocks don't open new scopes = ENUM在EXTERN中聲明。.END EXTERN塊不會打開新作用域
ERASE on UDT with non-CDECL constructor = 使用非CDECL構造函數的UDT的ERASE
ERASE on UDT with non-CDECL destructor = 使用非CDECL析構函數的UDT的ERASE
ERASE on UDT with non-parameterless default constructor = 使用非參數預設構造函數的UDT的ERASE
Executable not found = 找不到可執行檔
Expected '-' = 應該是'-'
Expected '#ENDIF' = 應該是’#ENDIF'
Expected '(' = 應該是'('
Expected ')' = 應該是')'
Expected ',' = 應該是','
Expected ':' = 應該是':'
Expected ';' = 應該是';'
Expected ']' = 應該是']'
Expected '{' = 應該是' {'
Expected '}' = 應該是'}'
Expected '~' = 應該是'='
Expected '>' = 應該是“>”
Expected a CLASS, TYPE or UNION symbol type = 應該是CLASS，TYPE或UNION符號類型
Expected 'ANY' = 應該是'ANY'
Expected array = 應該是陣列
Expected 'AS' = 應該是“ AS”
Expected 'CASE' = 應該是'CASE'
Expected class or UDT identifier = 應該是類別或UDT識別字
Expected constant = 應該是常數
