Expected expression = 應該是運算式
Expected 'FOR' = 應該是“ FOR”
Expected identifier = 應該是識別字
Expected initializer = 應該是初始值設定項
Expected 'LOOP' = 應該是' LOOP'
Expected 'NEXT' = 應該是'NEXT'
Expected operator = 應該是操作符
