EXTERN or COMMON dynamic arrays cannot have initial bounds = EXTERN或COMMON動態陣列不能具有初始範圍
EXTERN or COMMON variables cannot be initialized = EXTERN或COMMON變數無法初始化
Fields cannot be named as keywords in TYPE's that contain member functions or in CLASS'es = 欄位不能在包含成員函數的TYPE中或在CLASS中命名為關鍵字
Fields with constructors cannot be part of UNION's or nested TYPE's = 具有構造函數的欄位不能是UNION或嵌套TYPE的一部分
Fields with destructors cannot be part of UNION's or nested TYPE's = 具有析構函數的欄位不能是UNION或嵌套TYPE的一部分
File access error = 檔存取錯誤
Fixed-len strings cannot be returned from functions = 不能從函數返固定長度字串
Fixed-length string combined with BYREF (not supported) = 定長字串與BYREF結合使用（不支援）
FOR/NEXT variable name mismatch = FOR / NEXT變數名稱不匹配
Forward references not allowed = 不允許轉發參考值
FreeBasic Compiler = freeBasic 編譯器
FUNCTION ~' or EXIT FUNCTION mixed with RETURN (using both styles together is unsupported when returning objects with constructors) = FUNCTION ='或EXIT FUNCTION與RETURN混合使用（返回帶有構造函數的物件時，不支援同時使用兩種樣式）
Function not declared = 未聲明函數
