Function result was not explicitly set = 未明確設置函數返回值
GOSUB disabled, use 'OPTION GOSUB' to enable = GOSUB已停用，請使用“ OPTION GOSUB”啟用
Identifier cannot include periods = 識別字不能包含句點
Identifier's name too big, truncated = 識別字的名稱太大，已被截斷
'IF' statement found directly after multi-line 'ELSE' = 在多行“ ELSE”之後直接找到“ IF”語句
Illegal 'END' = 非法的' END'
Illegal inside a compound statement or scoped block = 複合陳述式或作用域塊內非法
Illegal inside a NAMESPACE block = NAMESPACE塊內非法
Illegal inside functions = 非法內建函式
Illegal member access = 非法會員訪問
Illegal non-static member access = 非法的非靜態成員訪問
Illegal outside a CLASS, TYPE or UNION method = 在CLASS，TYPE或UNION方法之外非法
Illegal outside a compound statement = 複合陳述式外非法
Illegal outside a CONSTRUCTOR block = 在CONSTRUCTOR塊外非法
Illegal outside a CONSTRUCTOR, DESTRUCTOR, FUNCTION, OPERATOR, PROPERTY or SUB block = 在構造函數，析構函數，函數，運算子，屬性或子塊之外非法
Illegal outside a DESTRUCTOR block = 在DESTRUCTOR塊外非法
Illegal outside a DO compound statement = 在DO複合陳述式之外非法
Illegal outside a FOR compound statement = 在FOR複合陳述式之外非法
Illegal outside a FUNCTION block = 在函數塊外非法
Illegal outside a PROPERTY block = 在PROPERTY區塊外非法
Illegal outside a SELECT compound statement = SELECT複合陳述式外非法
Illegal outside a SUB block = SUB塊外非法
Illegal outside a WHILE compound statement = 在WHILE複合陳述式之外非法
Illegal outside an OPERATOR block = 在OPERATOR區外非法
Illegal specification = 違規
Illegal without the -ex option = 不帶-ex選項則非法
Implemented body for an ABSTRACT method = ABSTRACT方法的實現主體
Implicit conversion = 隱式轉換
Implicit destructor override would have different calling convention = 隱式析構函數重載將具有不同的調用約定
Implicit LET operator override would have different calling convention = 隱式LET運算子重載將具有不同的調用約定
Implicit variable allocation = 隱式變數分配
Implicit variables are only valid in -lang = 隱式變數僅在-lang中有效
Incompatible reference initializer = 不相容的引用初始值設定項
Incomplete type = 不完整的類型
Internal! = 內部！
Invalid array index = 無效的陣列索引
Invalid array subscript = 無效的陣列下標
Invalid assignment/conversion = 無效的分配/轉換
Invalid bitfield = 無效的位域
Invalid CASE range, start value is greater than the end value = CASE範圍無效，起始值大於終止值
Invalid character = 無效字元
Invalid command-line option = 無效的命令列選項
Invalid data types = 無效的資料類型
Invalid initializer = 無效的初始化
Invalid -lang = 無效的-lang
Invalid parameter type, it must be the same as the parent TYPE/CLASS = 無效的參數類型，必須與父TYPE/ CLASS相同
Invalid preprocessor directive = 無效的前置處理器指令
Invalid priority attribute = 無效的優先順序屬性
Invalid result type for this operator = 該運算子的結果類型無效
Invalid size = 無效的尺寸
LIB name string is empty = LIB名稱字串為空
Literal number too big, truncated = 文字數太大，被截斷
Literal string too big, truncated = 文字字串太大，被截斷
Local symbols can't be referenced = 不能引用本地符號
LOOP without DO = LOOP 沒有 DO
Macro numbering = 當前行宏處理行號
Macro text too long = 巨集文本太長
Member cannot be static = 成員不能是靜態的
Member isn't static = 成員不是靜態的
Method declared ABSTRACT, but UDT does not extend OBJECT = 方法聲明為ABSTRACT，但是UDT不擴展OBJECT
Method declared in anonymous UDT = 在匿名UDT中聲明的方法
Method declared VIRTUAL, but UDT does not extend OBJECT = 方法聲明為VIRTUAL，但UDT不擴展OBJECT
Mismatching parameter initializer = 參數初始化程式不匹配
Missing BASE() initializer (base UDT without default constructor requires manual initialization) = 缺少BASE()初始化程式（沒有預設構造函數的基本UDT需要手動初始化）
Missing closing quote in literal string = 文字字串中缺少結束語
Missing command-line option for = 缺少命令列選項
Missing default constructor implementation (base UDT without default constructor requires manual initialization) = 缺少預設構造函數實現（沒有預設構造函數的基本UDT需要手動初始化）
Missing overloaded operator:  = 缺少重載運算子：
Missing RETURN to copy-construct function result = 缺少RETURN以複製構造函數的結果
Missing UDT.constructor(byref as const UDT) implementation (base UDT without default constructor requires manual initialization) = 缺少UDT.constructor(byref as const UDT)實現（沒有預設構造函數的基本UDT需要手動初始化）
Missing UDT.constructor(byref as UDT) implementation (base UDT without default constructor requires manual initialization) = 缺少UDT.constructor(byref as UDT)實現（沒有預設構造函數的基本UDT需要手動初始化）
Mixing signed/unsigned operands = 混合有符號/無符號運算元
Must have initializer with array with ellipsis bound = 必須具有帶有省略號綁定的陣列的初始化程式
NEXT without FOR = NEXT沒有FOR
No end of multi-line comment, expected ""'/"" = 多行注釋無結尾，應為' /'
No explicit BYREF or BYVAL = 沒有明確的BYREF或BYVAL
No matching overloaded function = 沒有匹配的重載函數
No outer DO compound statement found = 找不到外部DO複合陳述式
No outer FOR compound statement found = 找不到外部FOR複合陳述式
No outer SELECT compound statement found = 找不到外部SELECT複合陳述式
No outer WHILE compound statement found = 找不到外部的WHILE複合陳述
Non-virtual call to ABSTRACT method = 非虛擬調用ABSTRACT方法
Not extending a TYPE/UNION (a TYPE/UNION can only extend other TYPEs/UNIONs) = 不擴展TYPE / UNION（TYPE / UNION只能擴展其他TYPE / UNION）
Not overriding any virtual method = 不重載任何虛擬方法
-o <file> option without corresponding input file = 在-o <file>選項,不帶相應的輸入檔
Object files or libraries with mixed language (-lang) options = 具有混合語言（-lang）選項的目的檔案或庫
Object files or libraries with mixed multithreading (-mt) options = 具有混合多執行緒（-mt）選項的目的檔案或庫
Objects with default [con|de]structors or methods are only allowed in the module level = 具有默認[con|de]或方法的物件僅在模組層級別被允許
Only data members supported = 僅支援資料成員
Only static members can be accessed from static functions and parameter initializers = 只能從靜態函數和參數初始值設定項訪問靜態成員
Only valid in -lang = 僅在-lang中有效
Operator cannot be a member function = 運算子不能是成員函數
Operator must be a member function = 運算子必須是成員函數
Overflow in constant conversion = 常量轉換溢出
Override has different calling convention than overridden method = 重載具有與重載方法不同的調用約定
Override has different parameters than overridden method = 重載與重載方法具有不同的參數
Override has different return type than overridden method = 重載具有與重載方法不同的返回類型
Override is a CONST member, but the overridden method is not = 重載是CONST成員，但重載的方法不是
Override is not a CONST member like the overridden method = 重載不是像重載方法那樣的CONST成員
Parameter and result can't be of the same type = 參數和結果不能為同一類型
Parameter cannot be optional = 參數不能為可選
Parameter must be a pointer = 參數必須是指標
Parameter must be an integer = 參數必須是整數
Parameter or result must be a user-defined type = 參數或結果必須是用戶定義的類型
Parameter type mismatch = 參數類型不匹配
Parent is not a class or UDT = 父級不是CLASS或UDT
Passing different pointer types = 傳遞不同的指針類型
Passing Pointer = 傳遞指針
Passing pointer to scalar = 將指標傳遞到變數
Passing scalar as pointer = 將變數作為指標傳遞
Permission denied = 許可權被拒絕
-pic used when making executable (only works when making a shared library) = 在執行可執行檔時使用-pic(僅在創建共用庫時有效)
-pic used, but not supported by target system (only works for non-x86 Unixes) = 使用-pic,但不受目標系統支援(僅適用於非x86 Unixes)
Possible escape sequence found in = 找到可能的轉義序列
Procedure macro numbering = 當前過程內宏處理所有行號
PROPERTY GET should have no parameter, or just one if indexed = PROPERTY GET應該沒有參數，或者如果被索引則只有一個
PROPERTY has no GET method/accessor = PROPERTY沒有GET方法/訪問器
PROPERTY has no indexed GET method/accessor = PROPERTY沒有索引的GET方法/訪問器
PROPERTY has no indexed SET method/accessor = PROPERTY沒有索引的SET方法/訪問器
PROPERTY has no SET method/accessor = PROPERTY沒有SET方法/訪問器
PROPERTY SET should have one parameter, or just two if indexed = 屬性集應該有一個參數，如果有索引則應該只有兩個
Range too large = 範圍太大
Recursion level too deep = 遞迴級別太深
Recursive DEFINE not allowed = 不允許遞迴DEFINE
Recursive TYPE or UNION not allowed = 不允許遞迴TYPE或UNION
Redefinition of intrinsic = 重新定義內在
REDIM on UDT with non-CDECL constructor = 使用非CDECL構造函數的UDT上的REDIM
REDIM on UDT with non-CDECL destructor = 使用非CDECL析構函數的UDT上的REDIM
REDIM on UDT with non-parameterless default constructor = 使用非參數預設構造函數的UDT上的REDIM
Reference not initialized = 引用未初始化
Resource file given for target system that does not support them = 為不支援目標系統的目標系統提供的資源檔
Return method mismatch = 返回方法不匹配
RETURN mixed with 'FUNCTION ~' or EXIT FUNCTION (using both styles together is unsupported when returning objects with constructors) = RETURN與'FUNCTION ='或EXIT FUNCTION混合使用(返回帶有構造函數的物件時，不支援同時使用兩種樣式)
Return type here does not match DECLARE prototype = 此處的返回類型與DECLARE原型不匹配
Selected -gen gas ASM backend for non-x86 CPU = 針對非x86 CPU的選定-gen gas ASM後端
Selected non-x86 CPU when compiling for DOS = 為DOS編譯時選擇了非x86 CPU
Selected option requires an SSE FPU mode = 所選選項需要SSE FPU模式
Shift value greater than or equal to number of bits in data type = 移位值大於或等於資料類型中的位數
Statement in between SELECT and first CASE = SELECT和第一個CASE之間的語句
Static member variable in nested UDT (only allowed in toplevel UDTs) = 嵌套UDT中的靜態成員變數（僅在頂級UDT中允許）
STATIC used here, but not the in the DECLARE statement = 此處使用STATIC，但在DECLARE語句中未使用
STATIC used on non-member procedure = STATIC用於非成員程式
Static variable declared in anonymous UDT = 在匿名UDT中聲明的靜態變數
'SUB' or 'FUNCTION' without 'END SUB' or 'END FUNCTION' = SUB'或'FUNCTION'，沒有配對的'END SUB'或'END FUNCTION'
Suffixes are only valid in -lang = 尾碼僅在-lang中有效
Suspicious logic operation, mixed boolean and non-boolean operands = 可疑的邏輯運算，布林和非布林混合運算數
Suspicious pointer assignment = 可疑指針分配
Symbol not a CLASS, ENUM, TYPE or UNION type = 符號不是CLASS，ENUM，TYPE或UNION類型
Symbol type has no Run-Time Type Info (RTTI) = 符號類型沒有運行時類型資訊（RTTI）
Symbols defined inside namespaces cannot be removed = 不能刪除命名空間中定義的符號
Syntax error = 語法錯誤
The ANY initializer has no effect on UDT's with default constructors = 帶有預設構造函數的ANY初始化程式對UDT無效
The default constructor has no public access = 預設構造函數沒有公共存取權限
the first parameter in a procedure may not be vararg = 過程中的第一個參數不能為vararg
The length of the parameters list is too large, consider passing UDT's BYREF = 參數列表的長度太大，請考慮傳遞UDT的BYREF
The NEW operator cannot be used with fixed-length strings = NEW運算子不能與定長字串一起使用
The NEW[] operator does not allow explicit calls to constructors = NEW []運算子不允許顯式調用構造函數
The NEW[] operator only supports the { ANY } initialization = NEW []運算子僅支持{ANY}初始化
The PRIVATE and PUBLIC attributes are not allowed with REDIM, COMMON or EXTERN = REDIM，COMMON或EXTERN不允許使用PRIVATE和PUBLIC屬性
The type length is too large, consider passing BYREF = 類型長度太大，請考慮傳遞BYREF
This operator cannot be STATIC = 此運算子不能為STATIC
This operator is implicitly STATIC and cannot be CONST = 該運算子是隱式靜態的，不能為CONST
This operator is implicitly STATIC and cannot be VIRTUAL or ABSTRACT = 該運算子是隱式靜態的，不能為虛擬或抽象
This symbol cannot be undefined = 此符號不能不確定
Too many array dimensions = 陣列維數過多
Too many elements = 元素太多
Too many errors = 錯誤太多
Too many expressions = 運算式太多
