vararg parameters are only allowed in CDECL procedures = vararg參數僅在CDECL過程中允許
Variable following NEXT is meaningless = NEXT之後的變數沒有意義
Variable not declared = 未聲明變數
Variable required = 需要變數
Variable too large for stack, consider making it SHARED = 變數對於堆疊而言太大，請考慮使其共用(SHARED)
