[Compiler]
...' ellipsis upper bound given for array field (this is not supported) = 为数组字段指定的'...'省略号上限（不支持）
...' ellipsis upper bound given for dynamic array (this is not supported) = 动态数组指定的'...'省略号上限（不支持）
~' parsed as equality operator in function argument, not assignment to BYREF function result = '='在函数参数中解析为相等运算符，未分配给BYREF函数结果
A destructor should not have any parameters = 析构函数不应具有任何参数
ABSTRACT used here, but not the in the DECLARE statement = 这里使用了ABSTRACT，但在DECLARE语句中没有使用
ABSTRACT used on non-member procedure = 非成员过程中使用ABSTRACT 
Accessing base UDT's private default constructor = 访问基本UDT的私有默认构造函数
Accessing base UDT's private destructor = 访问基本UDT的私有析构函数
ALIAS name here does not match ALIAS given in DECLARE prototype = 此处的ALIAS名称与DECLARE原型中提供的ALIAS不匹配
ALIAS name string is empty = ALIAS名称字符串为空
Ambiguous call to overloaded function = 对重载函数的歧义调用
Ambiguous symbol access, explicit scope resolution required = 符号访问不明确，需要明确的范围解析
An ENUM, TYPE or UNION cannot be empty = ENUM，TYPE或UNION不能为空
Argument count mismatch = 参数计数不匹配
Array access, index expected = 访问数组需要索引
Array already dimensioned = 数组维数已确定
Array boundaries do not match the original EXTERN declaration = 数组边界与原始EXTERN声明不匹配
Array not dimensioned = 数组未标注维数
Array of references - not supported yet = 引用的数组-尚不支持
Array out-of-bounds = 数组越界
Array too big = 数组太大
Array too large for stack, consider making it var-len or SHARED = 数组太大而不能堆叠，请考虑使其变长或共享(var-len or SHARED)
Arrays are not allowed = 不允许数组
-asm att used for -gen gas, but -gen gas only supports -asm intel = 用-asm att在-gen gas,但是-gen gas仅支持-asm intel
-asm att|intel option given, but not supported for this target (only x86 or x86_64) = 已提供-asm att|intel 选项，但此目标不支持（仅x86或x86_64）
At least one parameter must be a user-defined type = 至少一个参数必须是用户定义的类型
at parameter = 在参数表中的第
Auto variables are only valid in -lang = 自动变量仅在-lang中有效
BASE() initializer not at top of constructor = BASE()初始化程序不在构造函数的顶部
Both parameters can't be of the same type = 两个参数不能属于同一类型
Branch crossing local array, var-len string or object definition = 跨越了局部数组，var-len字符串或对象定义的分支
Branch crossing local variable definition = 分支交叉局部变量定义
Branching to other functions or to module-level = 到其他函数或模块级别的分支
Branching to scope block containing local variables = 到包含局部变量的作用域块的分支
Byref function result not set = 未设置Byref函数结果
Calling convention does not match DECLARE prototype = 调用约定与DECLARE原型不匹配
Cannot export symbol without -export option = 没有-export选项就无法导出符号
Cannot modify a constant = 无法修改常数
Cannot pop stack, underflow = 无法弹出堆栈，下溢
Can't use ... as lower bound = 不能使用...作为下限
Can't use ANY as initializer in array with ellipsis bound = 不能在带省略号的数组中将ANY用作初始化程序
CASE without SELECT = CASE没有 SELECT
Cast to non-pointer = 强制转换为非指针
Casting derived UDT pointer from incompatible pointer type = 从不兼容的指针类型转换派生的UDT指针
Casting derived UDT pointer from unrelated UDT pointer type = 从不相关的UDT指针类型转换派生的UDT指针
Casting derived UDT pointer to incompatible pointer type = 将派生的UDT指针转换为不兼容的指针类型
Casting derived UDT pointer to unrelated UDT pointer type = 将派生的UDT指针转换为不相关的UDT指针类型
CLASS, TYPE or UNION has no constructor = CLASS，TYPE或UNION没有构造函数
CLASS, TYPE or UNION not derived = 不能派生CLASS，TYPE或UNION
Cloning operators (LET, Copy constructors) can't take a byval arg of the parent's type = 克隆运算符（LET，Copy构造函数）不能采用父类型的byval参数
Command line option overrides directive = 命令行选项重载指令
COMMON variables cannot be object instances of CLASS/TYPE's with cons/destructors = COMMON变量不能是带有缺点/析构函数的CLASS / TYPE的对象实例
Const UDT cannot invoke non-const method = const UDT无法调用非const方法
CONST used here, but not the in the DECLARE statement = 在此使用CONST，但在DECLARE语句中未使用
CONST used on constructor (not needed) = 在构造函数上使用CONST（不需要）
CONST used on destructor (not needed) = 在析构函数上使用CONST（不需要）
CONST used on non-member procedure = CONST用于非成员过程
Constant declared in anonymous UDT = 在匿名UDT中声明的常量
Constructor declared ABSTRACT = 构造函数声明为ABSTRACT
Constructor declared VIRTUAL = 构造函数声明为虚拟
Constructor has no public access = 构造函数没有公共访问权限
CONSTRUCTOR() chain call not at top of constructor = CONSTRUCTOR()的调用不在构造函数的顶部
Could not find file = 找不到文件
Declaration outside the original namespace = 在命名空间之外的声明
Declaration outside the original namespace or class = 在原始命名空间或类之外的声明
Default types or suffixes are only valid in -lang = 默认类型或后缀仅在-lang中有效
Default types or suffixes are only valid in -lang deprecated or fblite or qb = 指定默认类型或使用后缀已弃用，仅在 -lang 、fblite 或 qb 中有效
Deleting ANY pointers is undefined = 删除任何指针是未定义的
Destructor declared ABSTRACT = 析构函数声明为ABSTRACT
Destructor has no public access = 析构函数没有公共访问权限
Directive ignored after first pass = 第一次通过后忽略指令
Division by zero = 被零除
Duplicated definition = 重复定义
Dynamic arrays cannot be part of UNION's or nested TYPE's = 动态数组不能是UNION或嵌套TYPE的一部分
Dynamic arrays can't be const = 动态数组不能为const
Element not defined = 元素未定义
Elements must be empty for strings and arrays = 字符串和数组的元素必须为空
ELSE without IF = ELSE没有  IF
ELSEIF without IF = ELSEIF没有  IF
END EXTERN without EXTERN = END EXTERN 没有  EXTERN
END IF without IF = END IF没有IF
END NAMESPACE without NAMESPACE = END NAMESPACE 没有  NAMESPACE
END SCOPE without SCOPE = END SCOPE没有 SCOPE
END SELECT without SELECT = END SELECT 没有SELECT
END SUB or FUNCTION without SUB or FUNCTION = END SUB或FUNCTION，没有SUB或FUNCTION
END WITH without WITH = END WITH没有WITH
ENUM's declared inside EXTERN .. END EXTERN blocks don't open new scopes = ENUM在EXTERN中声明。.END EXTERN块不会打开新作用域
ERASE on UDT with non-CDECL constructor = 使用非CDECL构造函数的UDT的ERASE
ERASE on UDT with non-CDECL destructor = 使用非CDECL析构函数的UDT的ERASE
ERASE on UDT with non-parameterless default constructor = 使用非参数默认构造函数的UDT的ERASE
Executable not found = 找不到可执行文件
Expected '-' = 应该是'-'
