Expected 'END FUNCTION' = 应该是'END FUNCTION'
Expected 'END IF' = 应该是'END IF'
Expected 'END NAMESPACE' = 应该是'END NAMESPACE'
Expected 'END OPERATOR' = 应该是'END OPERATOR'
Expected 'END PROPERTY' = 应该是'END PROPERTY'
Expected 'END SCOPE' = 应该是'END SCOPE
Expected 'END SELECT' = 应该是'END SELECT'
Expected 'END SUB' = 应该是'END SUB'
