<dl>
<dt>Usage</dt><dd><tt>JNS&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;label</tt></dd>
<dt>Modifies flags</dt><dd>None</dd>
</dl>
<p>
Causes execution to branch to "label" if the Sign Flag is clear. Signed com=
parison.
</p></div>

