Sets surface as the icon for a given drag. GTK+ retainsreferences for the arguments, and will release them whenthey are no longer needed.To position the surface relative to the mouse, usecairo_surface_set_device_offset  on surface. The mousecursor will be positioned at the (0,0) coordinate of thesurface.
