------------ KeyGTK3gtk_action_group_add_radio_actions ----
gtk_action_group_add_radio_actions 
gtk_action_group_add_radio_actions has been deprecated since version 3.10 and should not be used in newly-written code.This is a convenience routine to create a group of radio actions andadd them to the action group. The ?changed? signal of the first radio action is connected to the on_change callback and the accel paths of the actions are set to <Actions>/group-name/action-name.
