------------ KeyGTK3GtkBuilderConnectFunc ----
GtkBuilderConnectFunc 
This is the signature of a function used to connect signals.  It is usedby the gtk_builder_connect_signals  and gtk_builder_connect_signals_full methods.  It is mainly intended for interpreted language bindings, butcould be useful where the programmer wants more control over the signalconnection process. Note that this function can only be called once,subsequent calls will do nothing.
Syntax
Parameters
builder    	a GtkBuilder
object    	object to connect a signal to
signal_name    	name of the signal
handler_name    	name of the handler
connect_object    	a GObject, if non-NULL, use g_signal_connect_object 
flags    	GConnectFlags to use
user_data    	user data
Since 2.12

