------------ KeyGTK3gtk_cell_renderer_text_set_fixed_height_from_font ----
gtk_cell_renderer_text_set_fixed_height_from_font 
Sets the height of a renderer to explicitly be determined by the ?font? and?y_pad? property set on it.  Further changes in these properties do notaffect the height, so they must be accompanied by a subsequent call to thisfunction.  Using this function is unflexible, and should really only be usedif calculating the size of a cell is too slow (ie, a massive number of cellsdisplayed).  If number_of_rows is -1, then the fixed height is unset, andthe height is determined by the properties again.
Syntax
Parameters
renderer    	A GtkCellRendererText
number_of_rows    	Number of rows of text each cell renderer is allocated, or -1[br \=""
