------------ KeyGTK3gtk_cell_renderer_toggle_set_radio ----
gtk_cell_renderer_toggle_set_radio 
If radio is TRUE, the cell renderer renders a radio toggle(i.e. a toggle in a group of mutually-exclusive toggles).If FALSE, it renders a check toggle (a standalone boolean option).This can be set globally for the cell renderer, or changed justbefore rendering each cell in the model (for GtkTreeView, you setup a per-row setting using GtkTreeViewColumn to associate modelcolumns with cell renderer properties).
Syntax
Parameters
toggle    	a GtkCellRendererToggle
radio    	TRUE to make the toggle look like a radio button

