------------ KeyGTK3gtk_check_menu_item_set_inconsistent ----
gtk_check_menu_item_set_inconsistent 
If the user has selected a range of elements (such as some text orspreadsheet cells) that are affected by a boolean setting, and thecurrent values in that range are inconsistent, you may want todisplay the check in an ?in between? state. This function turns on?in between? display.  Normally you would turn off the inconsistentstate again if the user explicitly selects a setting. This has to bedone manually, gtk_check_menu_item_set_inconsistent  only affectsvisual appearance, it doesn?t affect the semantics of the widget.
Syntax
Parameters
check_menu_item    	a GtkCheckMenuItem
setting    	TRUE to display an ?inconsistent? third state check

