new_text    	the text to append
new_text_length    	the length of the text in bytes, or -1
position    	 location of the position text will be inserted at. [inout]

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_editable_delete_text ----
gtk_editable_delete_text 
Deletes a sequence of characters. The characters that are deleted are those characters at positions from start_pos up to, but not including end_pos. If end_pos is negative, then the characters deletedare those from start_pos to the end of the text.Note that the positions are specified in characters, not bytes.
Syntax
Parameters
editable    	a GtkEditable
start_pos    	start position
end_pos    	end position

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_editable_get_chars ----
gtk_editable_get_chars 
