------------ KeyGTK3gtk_file_chooser_get_current_folder ----
gtk_file_chooser_get_current_folder 
Gets the current folder of chooser as a local filename.See gtk_file_chooser_set_current_folder .Note that this is the folder that the file chooser is currently displaying(e.g. "/home/username/Documents"), which is not the sameas the currently-selected folder if the chooser is inGTK_FILE_CHOOSER_ACTION_SELECT_FOLDER mode(e.g. "/home/username/Documents/selected-folder/".  To get thecurrently-selected folder in that mode, use gtk_file_chooser_get_uri  as theusual way to get the selection.
