Inserts the widget into box at position.If a sort function is set, the widget will actually be insertedat the calculated position and this function has the same effectas gtk_container_add .If position is -1, or larger than the total number of childrenin the box, then the widget will be appended to the end.
Syntax
Parameters
box    	a GtkFlowBox
widget    	the GtkWidget to add
position    	the position to insert childin
Since 3.12

