Syntax
Parameters
fontsel    	a GtkFontSelection
fontname    	a font name like ?Helvetica 12? or ?Times Bold 18?
Returns
 TRUE if the font could be set successfully; FALSE if nosuch font exists or if the fontseldoesn?t belong to a particularscreen yet.

