gtk_icon_info_load_symbolic_for_context_async 
Asynchronously load, render and scale a symbolic icon previously looked upfrom the icon theme using gtk_icon_theme_lookup_icon .For more details, see gtk_icon_info_load_symbolic_for_context  which is the synchronousversion of this call.
