gtk_icon_info_load_symbolic_for_context_finish 
Finishes an async icon load, see gtk_icon_info_load_symbolic_for_context_async .
Syntax
Parameters
icon_info    	a GtkIconInfo from gtk_icon_theme_lookup_icon 
res    	a GAsyncResult
was_symbolic    	 a gboolean, returns whether theloaded icon was a symbolic one and whether the fgcolor wasapplied to it. [out][allow-none]
