------------ KeyGTK3gtk_icon_view_get_path_at_pos ----
gtk_icon_view_get_path_at_pos 
Finds the path at the point (x, y), relative to bin_window coordinates.See gtk_icon_view_get_item_at_pos , if you are also interested inthe cell at the specified position. See gtk_icon_view_convert_widget_to_bin_window_coords  for convertingwidget coordinates to bin_window coordinates.
Syntax
Parameters
