Notify the input method that the widget to which thisinput context corresponds has lost focus. The input methodmay, for example, change the displayed feedback or reset the contextsstate to reflect this change.
Syntax
Parameters
context    	a GtkIMContext

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_im_context_reset ----
gtk_im_context_reset 
Notify the input method that a change such as a change in cursorposition has been made. This will typically cause the inputmethod to clear the preedit state.
Syntax
Parameters
context    	a GtkIMContext

