gtk_im_multicontext_append_menuitems 
gtk_im_multicontext_append_menuitems has been deprecated since version 3.10 and should not be used in newly-written code.It is better to use the system-wide input    method framework for changing input methods. Modern    desktop shells offer on-screen displays for this that    can triggered with a keyboard shortcut, e.g. Super-Space.Add menuitems for various available input methods to a menu;the menuitems, when selected, will switch the input methodfor the context and the global default input method.
