------------ KeyGTK3gtk_list_store_set_valuesv ----
gtk_list_store_set_valuesv 
A variant of gtk_list_store_set_valist  whichtakes the columns and values as two arrays, instead ofvarargs. This function is mainly intended for language-bindings and in case the number of columns tochange is not known until run-time.
Syntax
Parameters
