Informs GTK+ on which monitor a menu should be popped up.See gdk_screen_get_monitor_geometry .This function should be called from a GtkMenuPositionFuncif the menu should not appear on the same monitor as the pointer.This information can?t be reliably inferred from the coordinatesreturned by a GtkMenuPositionFunc, since, for very long menus,these coordinates may extend beyond the monitor boundaries or eventhe screen boundaries.
