------------ KeyGTK3gtk_popover_set_position ----
gtk_popover_set_position 
Sets the preferred position for popover to appear. If the popoveris currently visible, it will be immediately updated.This preference will be respected where possible, althoughon lack of space (eg. if close to the window edges), theGtkPopover may choose to appear on the opposite side
Syntax
Parameters
popover    	a GtkPopover
position    	preferred popover position
Since 3.12

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_popover_get_position ----
gtk_popover_get_position 
Returns the preferred position of popover.
Syntax
Parameters
popover    	a GtkPopover
Returns
 The preferred position.

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_popover_set_modal ----
gtk_popover_set_modal 
Sets whether popover is modal, a modal popover will grab all inputwithin the toplevel and grab the keyboard focus on it when beingdisplayed. Clicking outside the popover area or pressing Esc willdismiss the popover and ungrab input.
Syntax
Parameters
popover    	a GtkPopover
modal    	TRUE to make popover claim all input within the toplevel
Since 3.12

