gtk_radio_action_new 
gtk_radio_action_new has been deprecated since version 3.10 and should not be used in newly-written code.Creates a new GtkRadioAction object. To add the action toa GtkActionGroup and set the accelerator for the action,call gtk_action_group_add_action_with_accel .
Syntax
