 a GtkAdjustment. [transfer none]

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_range_set_adjustment ----
gtk_range_set_adjustment 
Sets the adjustment to be used as the ?model? object for this rangewidget. The adjustment indicates the current range value, theminimum and maximum range values, the step/page increments usedfor keybindings and scrolling, and the page size. The page sizeis normally 0 for GtkScale and nonzero for GtkScrollbar, andindicates the size of the visible area of the widget being scrolled.The page size affects the size of the scrollbar slider.
Syntax
Parameters
range    	a GtkRange
adjustment    	a GtkAdjustment

