------------ KeyGTK3gtk_spin_button_new_with_range ----
gtk_spin_button_new_with_range 
This is a convenience constructor that allows creation of a numericGtkSpinButton without manually creating an adjustment. The value isinitially set to the minimum value and a page increment of 10 * stepis the default. The precision of the spin button is equivalent to theprecision of step.Note that the way in which the precision is derived works best if stepis a power of ten. If the resulting precision is not suitable for yourneeds, use gtk_spin_button_set_digits  to correct it.
Syntax
Parameters
min    	Minimum allowable value
max    	Maximum allowable value
step    	Increment added or subtracted by spinning the widget
Returns
 The new spin button as a GtkWidget

