------------ KeyGTK3gtk_style_context_save ----
gtk_style_context_save 
Saves the context state, so all modifications done throughgtk_style_context_add_class , gtk_style_context_remove_class ,gtk_style_context_add_region , gtk_style_context_remove_region or gtk_style_context_set_junction_sides  can be reverted in onego through gtk_style_context_restore .
Syntax
Parameters
context    	a GtkStyleContext
Since 3.0

