------------ KeyGTK3gtk_style_context_set_junction_sides ----
gtk_style_context_set_junction_sides 
Sets the sides where rendered elements (mostly throughgtk_render_frame ) will visually connect with other visual elements.This is merely a hint that may or may not be honoredby theming engines.Container widgets are expected to set junction hints as appropriatefor their children, so it should not normally be necessary to callthis function manually.
