name    	a mark name
Returns
 a GtkTextMark, or NULL. [transfer none]

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_text_buffer_get_insert ----
gtk_text_buffer_get_insert 
Returns the mark that represents the cursor (insertion point).Equivalent to calling gtk_text_buffer_get_mark  to get the marknamed ?insert?, but very slightly more efficient, and involves lesstyping.
