------------ KeyGTK3gtk_text_buffer_get_selection_bound ----
gtk_text_buffer_get_selection_bound 
Returns the mark that represents the selection bound.  Equivalentto calling gtk_text_buffer_get_mark  to get the mark named?selection_bound?, but very slightly more efficient, and involvesless typing.The currently-selected text in buffer is the region between the?selection_bound? and ?insert? marks. If ?selection_bound? and?insert? are in the same place, then there is no current selection.gtk_text_buffer_get_selection_bounds  is another convenient functionfor handling the selection, if you just want to know whether there?s aselection and what its bounds are.
