end    	other bound of range to be untagged

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_text_buffer_create_tag ----
gtk_text_buffer_create_tag 
Creates a tag and adds it to the tag table for buffer.Equivalent to calling gtk_text_tag_new  and then adding thetag to the buffer?s tag table. The returned tag is owned bythe buffer?s tag table, so the ref count will be equal to one.If tag_name is NULL, the tag is anonymous.If tag_name is non-NULL, a tag called tag_name must not alreadyexist in the tag table for this buffer.The first_property_name argument and subsequent arguments are a listof properties to set on the tag, as with g_object_set .
