gtk_text_iter_get_marks 
Returns a list of all GtkTextMark at this location. Because marksare not iterable (they don?t take up any "space" in the buffer,they are just marks in between iterable locations), multiple markscan exist in the same place. The returned list is not in anymeaningful order.
