gtk_text_iter_get_toggled_tags 
Returns a list of GtkTextTag that are toggled on or off at thispoint.  (If toggled_on is TRUE, the list contains tags that aretoggled on.) If a tag is toggled on at iter, then some non-emptyrange of characters following iter has that tag applied to it.  Ifa tag is toggled off, then some non-empty range following iterdoes not have the tag applied to it.
Syntax
Parameters
