gtk_text_iter_set_line_offset 
Moves iter within a line, to a new character(not byte) offset. The given character offset must be less than orequal to the number of characters in the line; if equal, itermoves to the start of the next line. Seegtk_text_iter_set_line_index  if you have a byte index rather thana character offset.
