gtk_text_tag_event 
Emits the ?event? signal on the GtkTextTag.
Syntax
Parameters
tag    	a GtkTextTag
event_object    	object that received the event, such as a widget
event    	the event
iter    	location where the event was received
Returns
 result of signal emission (whether the event was handled)

