gtk_tool_button_set_stock_id 
gtk_tool_button_set_stock_id has been deprecated since version 3.10 and should not be used in newly-written code.Use gtk_tool_button_set_icon_name  instead.Sets the name of the stock item. See gtk_tool_button_new_from_stock .The stock_id property only has an effect if notoverridden by non-NULL ?label? and ?icon_widget? properties.
Syntax
Parameters
