------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_model_iter_nth_child ----
gtk_tree_model_iter_nth_child 
Sets iter to be the child of parent, using the given index.The first index is 0. If n is too big, or parent has no children,iter is set to an invalid iterator and FALSE is returned. parentwill remain a valid node after this function has been called. As aspecial case, if parent is NULL, then the n-th root nodeis set.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_model    	a GtkTreeModel
iter    	 the GtkTreeIter to set to the nth child. [out]
