gtk_tree_model_iter_parent 
Sets iter to be the parent of child.If child is at the toplevel, and doesn?t have a parent, theniter is set to an invalid iterator and FALSE is returned.child will remain a valid node after this function has beencalled.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_model    	a GtkTreeModel
iter    	 the new GtkTreeIter to set to the parent. [out]
