------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_set_fixed_height_mode ----
gtk_tree_view_set_fixed_height_mode 
Enables or disables the fixed height mode of tree_view. Fixed height mode speeds up GtkTreeView by assuming that all rows have the same height. Only enable this option if all rows are the same height and allcolumns are of type GTK_TREE_VIEW_COLUMN_FIXED.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_view    	a GtkTreeView 
enable    	TRUE to enable fixed height mode
Since 2.6

