gtk_tree_view_column_clear 
Unsets all the mappings on all renderers on the tree_column.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_column    	A GtkTreeViewColumn

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_add_attribute ----
gtk_tree_view_column_add_attribute 
Adds an attribute mapping to the list in tree_column.  The column is thecolumn of the model to get a value from, and the attribute is theparameter on cell_renderer to be set from the value. So for exampleif column 2 of the model contains strings, you could have the?text? attribute of a GtkCellRendererText get its values fromcolumn 2.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_column    	A GtkTreeViewColumn.
cell_renderer    	the GtkCellRenderer to set attributes on
attribute    	An attribute on the renderer
column    	The column position on the model to get the attribute from.

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_set_attributes ----
gtk_tree_view_column_set_attributes 
Sets the attributes in the list as the attributes of tree_column.The attributes should be in attribute/column order, as ingtk_tree_view_column_add_attribute . All existing attributesare removed, and replaced with the new attributes.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_column    	A GtkTreeViewColumn
cell_renderer    	the GtkCellRenderer we?re setting the attributes of
...    	A NULL-terminated list of attributes

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_set_cell_data_func ----
gtk_tree_view_column_set_cell_data_func 
