------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_get_fixed_width ----
gtk_tree_view_column_get_fixed_width 
Gets the fixed width of the column.  This may not be the actual displayedwidth of the column; for that, use gtk_tree_view_column_get_width .
