Gets the value set by gtk_tree_view_column_set_sort_order .
Syntax
Parameters
tree_column    	a GtkTreeViewColumn
Returns
 the sort order the sort indicator is indicating

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_cell_set_cell_data ----
gtk_tree_view_column_cell_set_cell_data 
Sets the cell renderer based on the tree_model and iter.  That is, forevery attribute mapping in tree_column, it will get a value from the setcolumn on the iter, and use that value to set the attribute on the cellrenderer.  This is used primarily by the GtkTreeView.
Syntax
Parameters
tree_column    	A GtkTreeViewColumn.
tree_model    	The GtkTreeModel to to get the cell renderers attributes from.
iter    	The GtkTreeIter to to get the cell renderer?s attributes from.
is_expander    	TRUE, if the row has children
is_expanded    	TRUE, if the row has visible children

------------ KeyGTK3gtk_tree_view_column_cell_get_size ----
gtk_tree_view_column_cell_get_size 
