gtk_widget_list_accel_closures 
Lists the closures used by widget for accelerator group connectionswith gtk_accel_group_connect_by_path  or gtk_accel_group_connect .The closures can be used to monitor accelerator changes on widget,by connecting to the GtkAccelGroup::accel-changed signal of theGtkAccelGroup of a closure which can be found out withgtk_accel_group_from_accel_closure .
