------------ KeyGTK3gtk_widget_grab_focus ----
gtk_widget_grab_focus 
Causes widget to have the keyboard focus for the GtkWindow it'sinside. widget must be a focusable widget, such as a GtkEntry;something like GtkFrame won?t work.More precisely, it must have the GTK_CAN_FOCUS flag set. Usegtk_widget_set_can_focus  to modify that flag.The widget also needs to be realized and mapped. This is indicated by therelated signals. Grabbing the focus immediately after creating the widgetwill likely fail and cause critical warnings.
