------------ KeyGTK3gtk_widget_style_attach ----
gtk_widget_style_attach 
gtk_widget_style_attach has been deprecated since version 3.0. and should not be used in newly-written code.This step is unnecessary with GtkStyleContext.This function attaches the widget?s GtkStyle to the widget'sGdkWindow. It is a replacement for                    1[/syntax]        [syntax]widget->style = gtk_style_attach (widget->style, widget->window);[/syntax]      
      and should only ever be called in a derived widget?s ?realize?implementation which does not chain up to its parent class'?realize? implementation, because one of the parent classes(finally GtkWidget) would attach the style itself.
