gtk_widget_get_size_request 
Gets the size request that was explicitly set for the widget usinggtk_widget_set_size_request . A value of -1 stored in width orheight indicates that that dimension has not been set explicitlyand the natural requisition of the widget will be used intead. Seegtk_widget_set_size_request . To get the size a widget willactually request, call gtk_widget_get_preferred_size  instead ofthis function.
