------------ KeyGTK3gtk_widget_get_preferred_width_for_height ----
gtk_widget_get_preferred_width_for_height 
Retrieves a widget?s minimum and natural width if it would be giventhe specified height.The returned request will be modified by theGtkWidgetClass::adjust_size_request virtual method and by anyGtkSizeGroups that have been applied. That is, the returned requestis the one that should be used for layout, not necessarily the onereturned by the widget itself.
