------------ KeyGTK3gtk_widget_compute_expand ----
gtk_widget_compute_expand 
Computes whether a container should give this widget extra spacewhen possible. Containers should check this, rather thanlooking at gtk_widget_get_hexpand  or gtk_widget_get_vexpand .This function already checks whether the widget is visible, sovisibility does not need to be checked separately. Non-visiblewidgets are not expanded.The computed expand value uses either the expand setting explicitlyset on the widget itself, or, if none has been explicitly set,the widget may expand if some of its children do.
