gtk_widget_class_bind_template_callback_full 
Declares a callback_symbol to handle callback_name from the template XMLdefined for widget_type. See gtk_builder_add_callback_symbol .Note that this must be called from a composite widget classes classinitializer after calling gtk_widget_class_set_template .
