------------ KeyGTK3gtk_window_set_default ----
gtk_window_set_default 
The default widget is the widget that?s activated when the userpresses Enter in a dialog (for example). This function sets orunsets the default widget for a GtkWindow. When setting (ratherthan unsetting) the default widget it?s generally easier to callgtk_widget_grab_default  on the widget. Before making a widgetthe default widget, you must call gtk_widget_set_can_default  onthe widget you?d like to make the default.
