<li><code> Size &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> Size &nbsp;|&nbsp; Returns/sets the height and width of the control. (Windows, Linux) <br \>
<li><code> SizeGrip &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> SizeGrip &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
<li><code> SliderVisible &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> SliderVisible &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
