<li><code> Smooth &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> Smooth &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
<li><code> Sort &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> Sort &nbsp;|&nbsp; Sorted alphabetically the items in the Control. <br \>
<li><code> Sorted &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> Sorted &nbsp;|&nbsp; Gets or sets a value indicating whether the items in the Control are sorted alphabetically. <br \>
<li><code> ssNone &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> ssNone &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
<li><code> ssSortAscending &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> ssSortAscending &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
