<li><code> WantReturn &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> WantReturn &nbsp;|&nbsp; Returns/sets  a carriage return be inserted when the user presses the ENTER key while entering text into a multiple-line edit control. This style has no effect on a single-line edit control. <br \>
<li><code> widget &nbsp;=&nbsp;</code> widget &nbsp;|&nbsp;  <br \>
